
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Alles ophalen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/locations

### Eén ophalen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/locations/1

### Aanmaken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/locations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "warehouseId": 6,
  "code": "LOC003",
  "name": "Rotterdam Location"
}

### Aanmaken (warehouse id is less than 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/locations
Content-Type: application/json


{
  "warehouseId": 0,
  "code": "LOC003",
  "name": "Rotterdam Location"
}

### Bestaat niet -> verwacht 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/locations/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "warehouseId": "1",
  "code": "LOC003",
  "name": "Rotterdam Location"
}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/locations/4

### Bestaat niet -> verwacht 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/locations/999

### Updated
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/locations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "warehouseId": "1",
  "code": "LOC003(updated)",
  "name": "Rotterdam Location"
}